              "text": "Thoracic Radiography",
              "pdf_page": 547,
              "printed_page": 465,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Most esophageal foreign bodies are",
              "pdf_page": 547,
